WEBVTT

00:00:01.199 --> 00:00:04.400
And me, and good morning, ladies. It's time

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.200
to get up. Come on,

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.320
Starlight,

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:11.320
transform, prepare the guns, and we'll

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.040
finish this. Okay, I'm coming.